# Pharmacy Patient Flow

## 0. Overview

This file is the direct Pharmacy flow source of truth for HOSSPI HMS. Pharmacy is an **executing department** â" orders attach to **encounter_id**. Pharmacy dispenses; Nursing records administration (MAR) on IPD. Align with [`.cursor/flows/opd-flow.mdc`](./opd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/ipd-flow.mdc`](./ipd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/nursing-flow.mdc`](./nursing-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/discharge-flow.mdc`](./discharge-flow.mdc), and [`.cursor/app-write-up.mdc`](../app-write-up.mdc).

## 1. Goal

Enable pharmacists to fulfill medication orders: billing gates, prepare and attest dispense, manage returns, maintain stock visibility, and support **discharge take-home medicines**.

### Central encounter rule

Pharmacy executes dispensing on encounter-linked orders. It does not create encounters or own MAR administration.

